#: {{qualifier|colloquial}} {{uxi|ru|[[уехать|Уе́хать]] [[на]] '''юга́'''|to go to the south (e.g., to the Black Sea coast) for holiday}}
# [[South]] — southern part of any region
#: {{uxi|ru|[[жить]] [[на]] '''ю́ге'''|to live in the South (of Russia)}}
# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} [[southerly]] [[wind]]
